# Tests live at tests/ — vitest + playwright + e2e specs are not part of
# the production image. MSW browser worker is generated locally for E2E.
# Exception: src/main.tsx dynamically imports tests/mocks/browser behind
# import.meta.env.DEV. TypeScript still type-checks the dynamic import
# path, so the file must be in the build context. Vite tree-shakes the
# import in production (no runtime fetch). Keep just tests/mocks/.
tests
!tests/mocks/
tests-results
playwright-report
.vitest-cache

